# Rubblebelt Maverick: "When this creature enters, surveil 2" and "{G}, Exile this card from your graveyard: Put a +1/+1
# counter on target creature. Activate only as a sorcery." Faithless Looting (paid with Mox Ruby) discards one Maverick into
# the graveyard. The other is cast with Mox Emerald and surveils 2 (Island stays on top, Mountain goes to the graveyard,
# CR 701.25a). Then a Forest pays {G}: the graveyard Maverick is exiled as a cost and the battlefield one becomes 2/2.

